    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "And that concludes Eleonora Andreevna's first staff meeting. Notice how 'discipline and once again discipline' sets her no-nonsense tone for the season. See you in the next scene.",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "anya",
      "t": "В моём отеле должен быть идеальный порядок!",
      "gap": 0.3
